This repository contains no model weights. Training and sampling load the Stable Diffusion 3
Medium weights (stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium-diffusers) from the Hugging Face Hub. These
weights, and any weights derived from them (including student weights trained or exported with this
code), are not covered by the Apache License of this repository; they are subject to the license of
stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium as stated on its model card
(https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium). Data from COCO 2017
(https://cocodataset.org) is subject to its own terms of use.
